# Surge of Salvation: black and red sources' damage to Bot1's creatures is prevented (CR 615.1); a green source's is not, and
# damage Bot2's own red Lightning Bolt deals to Bot2's own creature is not either ("creatures you control"). Bot2 attacks with
# Embereth Shieldbreaker (red), Vampire Hexmage (black) and Elvish Spirit Guide (green), each blocked by a 0/2 Ornithopter, and
# Bot1 casts Surge. The Ornithopters that blocked the red and black attackers live (2 damage prevented each); the one that
# blocked the green Spirit Guide dies. Then Bolt kills the Spirit Guide.

